# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile is the repository root (see
# infra/production/docker-compose.yml). Since G4 that context is a tree
# unpacked from `git archive <sha>`, so nothing untracked should be there at
# all — this file is the second layer: on a developer machine, or if the
# release tree is ever prepared some other way, none of the below may reach
# an image.
.git/
.github/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.DS_Store
